Create the code-manuals search datastore
The root agent's local manual_search branch queries a Vertex AI Search datastore of internal code manuals. The lab bucket already contains the manual documents; here you create the datastore and import them.

Create the datastore with the ID code-manuals-datastore.

curl -X POST \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $(gcloud auth print-access-token)" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-Goog-User-Project: ${PROJECT_ID}" \
  "https://discoveryengine.googleapis.com/v1/projects/${PROJECT_ID}/locations/global/collections/default_collection/dataStores?dataStoreId=code-manuals-datastore" \
  -d '{"displayName":"Code manuals","industryVertical":"GENERIC","solutionTypes":["SOLUTION_TYPE_SEARCH"],"contentConfig":"CONTENT_REQUIRED"}'
Copied!
Import the manual documents from the lab bucket into the datastore.

curl -X POST \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $(gcloud auth print-access-token)" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  "https://discoveryengine.googleapis.com/v1/projects/${PROJECT_ID}/locations/global/collections/default_collection/dataStores/code-manuals-datastore/branches/0/documents:import" \
  -d '{"reconciliationMode":"INCREMENTAL","gcsSource":{"inputUris":["gs://'${PROJECT_ID}'-bucket/code_manuals/*"],"dataSchema":"content"}}'
Copied!
Note: The datastore provisions in the background. If the import returns 403 PERMISSION_DENIED, wait about 10 seconds and run the command again. Ingestion takes a few minutes; you can continue with the next task while it completes.
