Create a Vertex AI Memory Bank for the Salesforce agent

Congratulations!
In this lab, you built a heterogeneous multi-agent system. You deployed agents from different frameworks to Agent Runtime, Cloud Run, and GKE; connected them over A2A using the correct variant and authentication for each host; generated an agent with the Antigravity coding agent; orchestrated the specialists as nodes in an ADK 2.0 graph workflow; and registered the system in Gemini Enterprise. You also gave the Salesforce agent long-term memory with Vertex AI Memory Bank, scoped per user across conversations, so it personalizes answers over time. You can now extend the system with any new specialist by giving it an agent card and mapping it into the root, no matter how or where it is built.

